    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Large Object</em></p><p><strong>Armor Class:</strong> 15 <strong>Hit Points:</strong> 100</p><p><em><strong>Mangonel Stone (Requires Load and Aim).</strong></em> <em>Ranged Attack Roll:</em> +5, range 200/800 ft. (can’t hit targets within 60 feet of itself). <em>Hit:</em> 27 (5d10) Bludgeoning damage.</p><p>A Mangonel is a catapult that hurls heavy projectiles in a high arc, so it can hit targets behind walls. Loading a Mangonel requires two Utilize actions, and aiming it requires two more Utilize actions. Then a crew member can take the Mangonel Stone action.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-oQPEnKsBa1SbEMRS\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>This item has 2 limited uses for tracking loading. Aiming must be tracked manually.</p><p>The <strong>Load</strong> activity grants one use so after two uses you can use the <strong>Mangonel Stone</strong> activity.</p></section>",
